flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to Patient Profile — Diet Plans tab]
    B --> C{Plan exists and status = completed?}
    C -->|No| D[Send button disabled]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -->|Yes| E{Authorized?\nAdmin or Doktor}
    E -->|No| F[Send button hidden]
    F --> Z
    E -->|Yes| G[Click Send to Patient]
    G --> H[POST /api/patients/id/diet-plans/planId/send]
    H --> I[Create DietPlanDelivery record\nstatus: pending]
    I --> J[Dispatch SendDietPlanEmailJob to queue]
    J --> K[Return 202]
    K --> L[Frontend shows pending delivery badge]
    L --> M[Job executes — send via Laravel Mail]
    M --> N{Email sent?}
    N -->|Yes| O[DietPlanDelivery status → sent]
    N -->|No| P[DietPlanDelivery status → failed]
    O --> Q[Badge updates to sent]
    P --> R[Badge updates to failed]
    Q --> Z
    R --> Z
